{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A survival-action game inspired by real-life events, Atomfall is set five years after the Windscale nuclear disaster in Northern England.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/a8445067309c2e9a60e91ff16b89ddb0.poster.avif?t=1770030485\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/a8445067309c2e9a60e91ff16b89ddb0.webm?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/a8445067309c2e9a60e91ff16b89ddb0.mp4?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the fictional quarantine zone, scavenge, craft, barter, fight and talk your way through a British countryside setting filled with bizarre characters, mysticism, cults, and rogue government agencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Rebellion, the studio behind Sniper Elite and Zombie Army, Atomfall will challenge you to solve the dark mystery of what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Driven Mystery:\u00a0</strong>Unravel a tapestry of interwoven narratives through exploration, conversation, investigation, and combat, where every choice you make has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/42c19dc6aea1e937f69754ee2fe3abd0.poster.avif?t=1770030485\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/42c19dc6aea1e937f69754ee2fe3abd0.webm?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/42c19dc6aea1e937f69754ee2fe3abd0.mp4?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search, Scavenge, Survive:\u00a0</strong>You\u2019ll need to scavenge for supplies, craft weapons and items, and fight desperately to make it out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desperate Combat:\u00a0</strong>With weapons and ammunition scarce, each frenetic engagement will see you blend marksmanship with vicious hand-to-hand combat. Manage your heart rate to hold a steady aim and ensure you have the energy you need to reach for your cricket bat and land the killer blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/e3f426c328344e282636d6c3f27f7e47.poster.avif?t=1770030485\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/e3f426c328344e282636d6c3f27f7e47.webm?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/e3f426c328344e282636d6c3f27f7e47.mp4?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green and Unpleasant Land:\u00a0</strong>The picturesque British countryside, with rolling green hills, lush valleys, and rural villages belie the dangers that await you. Navigate cult-controlled ruins, natural caves, nuclear bunkers and more as you explore this dense, foreboding world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/9a186a92107768e86e4f08b59668e09b.poster.avif?t=1770030485\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/9a186a92107768e86e4f08b59668e09b.webm?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/9a186a92107768e86e4f08b59668e09b.mp4?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reimagining Windscale:\u00a0</strong>A fictional reimagining of a real-world event, Atomfall draws from science fiction, folk horror, and Cold War influences to create a world that is eerily familiar yet completely alien.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"41fd92cc929cdad291dc58956461a9546e96e5aa.jpg","localized_name":"Back Door","name":"Back Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801800/41fd92cc929cdad291dc58956461a9546e96e5aa.jpg"},{"icon":"d44990c5828374c5cca9db3d921e9cb028b58e21.jpg","localized_name":"Emergency Extraction","name":"Emergency Extraction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801800/d44990c5828374c5cca9db3d921e9cb028b58e21.jpg"},{"icon":"80ff606de503f21bd7082aae7bd62178bf72b64d.jpg","localized_name":"At One with the Soil","name":"At One with the Soil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801800/80ff606de503f21bd7082aae7bd62178bf72b64d.jpg"},{"icon":"9ece4e769cd8386f7b9f97a5881f30f1f493a115.jpg","localized_name":"Operation Atomfall","name":"Operation Atomfall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801800/9ece4e769cd8386f7b9f97a5881f30f1f493a115.jpg"},{"icon":"5e5aebbd5dd3711d7c1d4651b3583240c2c69c80.jpg","localized_name":"Oubliette","name":"Oubliette","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801800/5e5aebbd5dd3711d7c1d4651b3583240c2c69c80.jpg"},{"icon":"0f09a998d290d3c9c18c73eb2353623c438a6da0.jpg","localized_name":"Do you require the Operator?","name":"Do you require the Operator?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801800/0f09a998d290d3c9c18c73eb2353623c438a6da0.jpg"},{"icon":"66f8dbfda08171e9d6f1b9735430547e930091b0.jpg","localized_name":"The Interchange","name":"The Interchange","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801800/66f8dbfda08171e9d6f1b9735430547e930091b0.jpg"},{"icon":"b4e389ac9a80b0c2ae232500d739f7cd825e006f.jpg","localized_name":"Alpha","name":"Alpha","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801800/b4e389ac9a80b0c2ae232500d739f7cd825e006f.jpg"},{"icon":"22200a3ce47696228644a309980fe97e78e34ccf.jpg","localized_name":"Bravo","name":"Bravo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801800/22200a3ce47696228644a309980fe97e78e34ccf.jpg"},{"icon":"e9aba0e8d0afdc84a9e63b4a28ed112876dd80c1.jpg","localized_name":"Charlie","name":"Charlie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801800/e9aba0e8d0afdc84a9e63b4a28ed112876dd80c1.jpg"}],"total":54},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/801800?t=1770030485","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770030485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/98d248a974dce69aa492fda6e933e6b6613c0881/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770030485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/98d248a974dce69aa492fda6e933e6b6613c0881/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770030485","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Our game contains:\r\n\r\nViolence:\r\nThe ability to kill characters with fists, melee weapons, throwables, guns and a bow.\r\nBlood splatter on hands and enemies after killing.\r\nBlood trails as environment decoration.\r\nPeople/monsters impaled on stakes (though not gory).\r\n\r\nAlcohol reference but not use or consumption of alcohol:\r\nVisible alcohol bottles used as crafting materials.\r\nThere's a pub that can be found in the Village\r\n\r\nImplied Nudity:\r\nA \"Feral\" character with covered genitals. Their torso is showing but there are no nipples. \r\n\r\nPotential Suicide Depiction:\r\nAn ambiguous scene where the player jumps into a pit, potentially a form of suicide, though not definitively death. \r\n\r\nCultist Rituals:\r\nThe presence of the staked people/monsters indicates cultist rituals."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Complete Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/0990912646224f5ce00e8e8867095972.avif?t=1770030485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras_big/0990912646224f5ce00e8e8867095972.avif?t=1770030485 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A survival-action game inspired by real-life events, Atomfall is set five years after the Windscale nuclear disaster in Northern England.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/a8445067309c2e9a60e91ff16b89ddb0.poster.avif?t=1770030485\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/a8445067309c2e9a60e91ff16b89ddb0.webm?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/a8445067309c2e9a60e91ff16b89ddb0.mp4?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the fictional quarantine zone, scavenge, craft, barter, fight and talk your way through a British countryside setting filled with bizarre characters, mysticism, cults, and rogue government agencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Rebellion, the studio behind Sniper Elite and Zombie Army, Atomfall will challenge you to solve the dark mystery of what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Driven Mystery:\u00a0</strong>Unravel a tapestry of interwoven narratives through exploration, conversation, investigation, and combat, where every choice you make has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/42c19dc6aea1e937f69754ee2fe3abd0.poster.avif?t=1770030485\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/42c19dc6aea1e937f69754ee2fe3abd0.webm?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/42c19dc6aea1e937f69754ee2fe3abd0.mp4?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search, Scavenge, Survive:\u00a0</strong>You\u2019ll need to scavenge for supplies, craft weapons and items, and fight desperately to make it out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desperate Combat:\u00a0</strong>With weapons and ammunition scarce, each frenetic engagement will see you blend marksmanship with vicious hand-to-hand combat. Manage your heart rate to hold a steady aim and ensure you have the energy you need to reach for your cricket bat and land the killer blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/e3f426c328344e282636d6c3f27f7e47.poster.avif?t=1770030485\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/e3f426c328344e282636d6c3f27f7e47.webm?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/e3f426c328344e282636d6c3f27f7e47.mp4?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green and Unpleasant Land:\u00a0</strong>The picturesque British countryside, with rolling green hills, lush valleys, and rural villages belie the dangers that await you. Navigate cult-controlled ruins, natural caves, nuclear bunkers and more as you explore this dense, foreboding world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/9a186a92107768e86e4f08b59668e09b.poster.avif?t=1770030485\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/9a186a92107768e86e4f08b59668e09b.webm?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/extras/9a186a92107768e86e4f08b59668e09b.mp4?t=1770030485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reimagining Windscale:\u00a0</strong>A fictional reimagining of a real-world event, Atomfall draws from science fiction, folk horror, and Cold War influences to create a world that is eerily familiar yet completely alien.</p>","developers":["Rebellion"],"dlc":[3252020,3607720,3047140,3047130,3047150],"drm_notice":"Denuvo Anti-tamper<br>5 different machines within 24 hours machine activation limit machine activation limit","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801800/header.jpg?t=1770030485","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a92025 Rebellion. All rights Reserved. The Rebellion name and logo, the Atomfall name and logo are trademarks of Rebellion and may be registered trademarks in certain countries.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/801800/854834/cda9afb606a12327670e8300b480ecf483e523bf/1750585384/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745399726","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/801800/854834/cda9afb606a12327670e8300b480ecf483e523bf/1750585384/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745399726","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/801800/854834/cda9afb606a12327670e8300b480ecf483e523bf/1750585384/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745399726","id":257116770,"name":"Pre-Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116770/ce0313ef129b8bb92813ebbf5226e9033e4d72c5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745399726"},{"dash_av1":"https